pe=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624990/extras/afbe4ded5baa8e38c03f5d0a83bb586d.mp4?t=1745593755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>\u21b3 Manage your time wisely</strong>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visit the hub</strong> to unlock heroes, trinkets, perma-perks and cooking recipes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to multiple shopkeepers to progress<strong> long-term relationship</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot legendary chests, read spell books, make bonfire offerings for godly boons<strong></strong><br><br><br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624990/extras/5e257a96b8ca25744e97707cb351ce04.poster.avif?t=1745593755\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624990/extras/5e257a96b8ca25744e97707cb351ce04.webm?t=1745593755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624990/extras/5e257a96b8ca25744e97707cb351ce04.mp4?t=1745593755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>\u21b3 Amazing chest ahead</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook and digest food. Receive buffs for eating!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft and loot weapons, equipable gear and <strong>game-changing</strong> accessories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Mix &amp; match</i></strong> upgrade synergies to eventually find something broken &amp; busted<br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624990/extras/e0d436cc04a791756af87d7bae115467.poster.avif?t=1745593755\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624990/extras/e0d436cc04a791756af87d7bae115467.webm?t=1745593755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624990/extras/e0d436cc04a791756af87d7bae115467.mp4?t=1745593755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>\u21b3 Pew pew pew</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/night cycle loop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless hordes of enemies at night</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bigger and scarier mobs every day that passes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How many nights can you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624990/extras/6e5657d795f2b9c1e8a9589b187a32d4.poster.avif?t=1745593755\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624990/extras/6e5657d795f2b9c1e8a9589b187a32d4.webm?t=1745593755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624990/extras/6e5657d795f2b9c1e8a9589b187a32d4.mp4?t=1745593755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>- This is very important! Very very important!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your wishlist holds immense power in steam visibility algorithm and will heavily determine the success or failure of this game. Thank you for your wishlist from the bottom of my heart! </p>",
    "short_description": "Enter The Night is a survival craft bullet heaven roguelite, where you'll mine resources in a procedurally generated world during the day, and pulverize massive hordes of enemies at night. Loot, harvest and craft. Break the game. Survive the night. Repeat.",
